{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_iwz5xysy5ksb4npohtnxtfsy2k6xrova4obtmajogabzxzijiiba","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_017dqzX5mEveeSL63VVM6Hd2","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-ws7ccv/translation/tests/probe.rs","content":"//! Scratch probe: hunt for the exact NaN operand orders GCC chose.\n\nmod common;\nuse common::*;\n\nfn show(label: &str, f: impl Fn(&Api) -> (u32, u32)) {\n    let e = f(c());\n    print!(\"{label:<44} C=({:#010x},{:#010x})\", e.0, e.1);\n    for r in rusts() {\n        let g = f(r);\n        print!(\"  {}=({:#010x},{:#010x}){}\", r.name, g.0, g.1, if g == e { \"\" } else { \"  <<< DIFF\" });\n    }\n    println!();\n}\n\nfn show1(label: &str, f: impl Fn(&Api) -> u32) {\n    let e = f(c());\n    print!(\"{label:<44} C={:#010x}\", e);\n    for r in rusts() {\n        let g = f(r);\n        print!(\"  {}={:#010x}{}\", r.name, g, if g == e { \"\" } else { \"  <<< DIFF\" });\n    }\n    println!();\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn probe_nan_orders() {\n    let na = f32::from_bits(0x7FC0_0001); // +QNaN payload 1\n    let nb = f32::from_bits(0xFFC0_0002); // -QNaN payload 2\n    let nc = f32::from_bits(0x7FC0_0003);\n    let nd = f32::from_bits(0xFFC0_0004);\n\n    println!(\"\\n-- c2Dot: which product/sum operand wins? --\");\n    // a.x*b.x -> NaN(a.x) vs NaN(b.x);  a.y*b.y -> NaN(a.y) vs NaN(b.y)\n    show1(\"c2Dot(ax=n1,ay=1 , bx=n2,by=1)\", |api| {\n        (api.c2Dot)(C2v { x: na, y: 1.0 }, C2v { x: nb, y: 1.0 }).to_bits()\n    });\n    show1(\"c2Dot(ax=1,ay=n1 , bx=1,by=n2)\", |api| {\n        (api.c2Dot)(C2v { x: 1.0, y: na }, C2v { x: 1.0, y: nb }).to_bits()\n    });\n    show1(\"c2Dot(ax=n1,ay=n3, bx=n2,by=n4)\", |api| {\n        (api.c2Dot)(C2v { x: na, y: nc }, C2v { x: nb, y: nd }).to_bits()\n    });\n    show1(\"c2Dot(ax=n1,ay=n3, bx=1 ,by=1 )\", |api| {\n        (api.c2Dot)(C2v { x: na, y: nc }, C2v { x: 1.0, y: 1.0 }).to_bits()\n    });\n\n    println!(\"\\n-- c2Mulvs: dst is a or b? --\");\n    show(\"c2Mulvs((n1,n3), n2)\", |api| {\n        vbits((api.c2Mulvs)(C2v { x: na, y: nc }, nb))\n    });\n    show(\"c2Mulvs((n1,1), n2)\", |api| {\n        vbits((api.c2Mulvs)(C2v { x: na, y: 1.0 }, nb))\n    });\n\n    println!(\"\\n-- c2CircletoCircle: A.r + B.r order --\");\n    // Make both radii NaN with different payloads; result is 0 either way,\n    // so probe through c2Dot-free path: use the *return* only. Need another\n    // observable... use circle_collide? No. Just record the int.\n    show1(\"c2CtC(A.r=n1, B.r=n2)\", |api| {\n        (api.c2CircletoCircle)(\n            C2Circle { p: C2v { x: 0.0, y: 0.0 }, r: na },\n            C2Circle { p: C2v { x: 0.0, y: 0.0 }, r: nb },\n        ) as u32\n    });\n\n    println!(\"\\n-- c2Sub: dst order --\");\n    show(\"c2Sub((n1,n3),(n2,n4))\", |api| {\n        vbits((api.c2Sub)(C2v { x: na, y: nc }, C2v { x: nb, y: nd }))\n    });\n\n    println!(\"\\n-- c2V passthrough --\");\n    show(\"c2V(snan, -0.0)\", |api| {\n        vbits((api.c2V)(f32::from_bits(0x7F80_0001), -0.0))\n    });\n\n    println!(\"\\n-- c2Maxv/Minv NaN + signed zero --\");\n    show(\"c2Maxv((n1,+0),(n2,-0))\", |api| {\n        vbits((api.c2Maxv)(C2v { x: na, y: 0.0 }, C2v { x: nb, y: -0.0 }))\n    });\n    show(\"c2Minv((n1,-0),(n2,+0))\", |api| {\n        vbits((api.c2Minv)(C2v { x: na, y: -0.0 }, C2v { x: nb, y: 0.0 }))\n    });\n\n    println!(\"\\n-- c2Dot SNaN quieting --\");\n    show1(\"c2Dot((snan,0),(1,1))\", |api| {\n        (api.c2Dot)(C2v { x: f32::from_bits(0x7F80_0001), y: 0.0 }, C2v { x: 1.0, y: 1.0 }).to_bits()\n    });\n    show1(\"c2Dot((0,snan),(1,1))\", |api| {\n        (api.c2Dot)(C2v { x: 0.0, y: f32::from_bits(0x7F80_0001) }, C2v { x: 1.0, y: 1.0 }).to_bits()\n    });\n    show1(\"c2Dot((0,0),(1,1)) 0*1+0*1\", |api| {\n        (api.c2Dot)(C2v { x: -0.0, y: -0.0 }, C2v { x: 1.0, y: 1.0 }).to_bits()\n    });\n    show1(\"c2Dot inf*0\", |api| {\n        (api.c2Dot)(C2v { x: f32::INFINITY, y: 0.0 }, C2v { x: 0.0, y: 0.0 }).to_bits()\n    });\n    show1(\"c2Dot inf + -inf\", |api| {\n        (api.c2Dot)(C2v { x: f32::INFINITY, y: f32::NEG_INFINITY }, C2v { x: 1.0, y: 1.0 }).to_bits()\n    });\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":371,"cache_read_input_tokens":71737,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":371,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9b90b9fb-d281-49bf-812e-b5b81b3c7dcd","uuid":"3727b34e-b550-453b-89d1-d1eab107d07a","timestamp":"2026-08-27T06:43:57.723Z"}
