{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01GfQREkMbLDj8hM1ga6psnM","type":"tool_result","content":"== building the C .so (as documented: no CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE => -O0)\nok   C .so = /local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-ws7ccv/translation/../c_src/build/libharvest-work-ws7ccv.so\n\n== declared non-default features: 0 (<none>)\n\n== feature combinations to verify: 2\n\n== combination: <default>\nok   <default> / release : symbol parity (12 symbols)\nok   <default> / debug : symbol parity (12 symbols)\nok   <default> : 107 tests passed\n\n== combination: --no-default-features\nok   --no-default-features / release : symbol parity (12 symbols)\nok   --no-default-features / debug : symbol parity (12 symbols)\nok   --no-default-features : 107 tests passed\n\n== summary\nALL FEATURE COMBINATIONS VERIFIED\nSCRIPT EXIT=0\n\n=== symbol diff (must be empty) ===\n(empty - 12/12 parity)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9b90b9fb-d281-49bf-812e-b5b81b3c7dcd","uuid":"0bd8cfbe-efc8-462c-afc1-446a17c745d7","timestamp":"2026-08-27T07:02:09.209Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"== building the C .so (as documented: no CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE => -O0)\nok   C .so = /local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-ws7ccv/translation/../c_src/build/libharvest-work-ws7ccv.so\n\n== declared non-default features: 0 (<none>)\n\n== feature combinations to verify: 2\n\n== combination: <default>\nok   <default> / release : symbol parity (12 symbols)\nok   <default> / debug : symbol parity (12 symbols)\nok   <default> : 107 tests passed\n\n== combination: --no-default-features\nok   --no-default-features / release : symbol parity (12 symbols)\nok   --no-default-features / debug : symbol parity (12 symbols)\nok   --no-default-features : 107 tests passed\n\n== summary\nALL FEATURE COMBINATIONS VERIFIED\nSCRIPT EXIT=0\n\n=== symbol diff (must be empty) ===\n(empty - 12/12 parity)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExp